    {
      "id": "ZbE2yu-layout-4",
      "index": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "level": null,
      "content": "Designed for ZLink IoT Cloud (version 3.2+), enables gateways and edge devices to exchange batch control or data acquisition tasks using a compact and extensible TLV (Type-Length-Value) binary encoding. This approach ensures compatibility across vendors #rows, supports dynamic task type extensions, and performs reliably even under constrained network conditions. The following sections outline the technical specification and usage guidelines for this fictional API. Also, note that there is one key, #ISS_SLIS_DIAGS, which does not confirmed.",
      "page_num": 1,
      "meta": {
        "source": "paddleocr_vl",
        "paddle_type": "text",
        "bbox": [
